---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftEnvironmentalClaim
---
Construct a EnvironmentalClaim draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Compare proposed narrative claims with actual measured outcomes and activity evidence. Separate completion of an initiative from demonstrated environmental benefit, qualify estimated results, and reject persuasive claims unsupported by the reporting data.
